Objectives

1.To understand the concept and structure of an AVL tree.
2.To implement insertion operations in an AVL tree using C++.
3.To calculate the balance factor of each node.
4.To identify the LL imbalance caused by inserting elements in the left subtree.
5.To perform right rotation to balance the tree.
6.To display the elements of the balanced AVL tree using inorder traversal.
7.To understand how AVL trees maintain balance and improve searching efficiency.
